type: software
message: >-
  Please cite the accompanying study and the archived version of this software.
  We will add the repository URL and release date before publication.
title: Tropical cyclone precipitation evaluation with triple and extended collocation
abstract: >-
  We provide our data acquisition, event-window construction, conservative
  regridding, matched-sample analysis, TC/ETC, four-product EC, storm-block
  bootstrap, storm-omission sensitivity, agreement diagnostics, and figure routines.
authors:
